---
layout: base.njk
title: Leaderboard
seoTitle: "Chip Leaderboard: Top Bagholders and Daily Winners | 0stakes"
description: The biggest chip balances on 0stakes and today's biggest winners. Chips are free play money with no cash value.
permalink: /leaderboard/
extraCss: /css/account.css
extraJs: /js/leaderboard.js
---
<div class="account">
  <h1>Leaderboard</h1>
  <p class="account-lede">Chips are play money with no cash value. Boards show usernames only and refresh each time you open this page.</p>

  {% if not supabase.url %}
  <p class="form-notice" role="status">The leaderboard isn't connected yet.</p>
  {% else %}
  <p class="form-status" id="lb-status" role="status"></p>

  <h2>Top 10 bagholders</h2>
  <p class="field-hint">Biggest chip balances right now.</p>
  <table class="ledger">
    <thead><tr><th class="num">#</th><th>Player</th><th class="num">Chips</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody id="lb-holders"><tr><td colspan="3">Loading...</td></tr></tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Top 10 daily winners</h2>
  <p class="field-hint">Biggest net winnings from games since midnight UTC (<span id="lb-reset"></span>).</p>
  <table class="ledger">
    <thead><tr><th class="num">#</th><th>Player</th><th class="num">Chips won</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody id="lb-daily"><tr><td colspan="3">Loading...</td></tr></tbody>
  </table>
  {% endif %}
</div>
